{"id":"abwesenheit","lemma":"Abwesenheit","pos":"noun","rank":3940,"glosses":["absence (state of being absent)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/De-Abwesenheit.ogg/De-Abwesenheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Abwesenheit","plural":"Abwesenheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Dunkelheit ist die Abwesenheit von Licht.","en":"Darkness is the absence of light.","words":[{"g":"darkness"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"light"}]},{"text":"Während deiner Abwesenheit ist viel passiert.","en":"A lot has happened while you've been gone.","words":[{"g":"while"},{"g":"yours, thine"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"to happen","l":"passieren"}]},{"text":"Ich bemerkte bald seine Abwesenheit.","en":"I soon noticed his absence.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to notice, to perceive","l":"bemerken"},{"g":"soon"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null]},{"text":"Niemand bemerkte ihre Abwesenheit.","en":"Nobody noticed her absence.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"to notice, to perceive","l":"bemerken"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Seine Abwesenheit war krankheitsbedingt.","en":"His absence was due to illness.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]}]}